# literal_translation = Or and when she-flutters in air and clouds, as of-others custom is of-soaring birds, on-high and shaggy both head and breast she-raised equal as-it-were, wings sails canvas and as having-spread, swiftly she-runs through land together with blasts of-wind, like a-certain self-moving on-foot ship, for-which then alone renowned of-deeds behind steersmen are.
